 class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-driven platforming</strong><br>Each room is a handcrafted challenge requiring clever thinking, precise movement, and careful use of magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master magical abilities</strong><br>Conjure blocks, break walls, burn foes, and manipulate your surroundings with a versatile set of spells.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781270/extras/490f5c96922b6609968f03a8e240ca34.avif?t=1758117023\" width=459 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging enemies and hazards</strong><br>Face off against enemies, traps, and shifting environments that test your reflexes and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and collectibles</strong><br>Explore hidden paths, uncover bonus challenges, and power up your character with rare items.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Peepod Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781270/6a5be8ac6dee87621aae05afb988d53f090d0657/header.jpg?t=1758117023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781270/1415333927/a974ef6c22486a25b1e7a94a8b1c8c401a845313/1751207802/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751209636","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781270/1415333927/a974ef6c22486a25b1e7a94a8b1c8c401a845313/1751207802/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751209636","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781270/1415333927/a974ef6c22486a25b1e7a94a8b1c8c401a845313/1751207802/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751209636",